# The modular manual pages, and the PDF renderings produced from them by
# man/scripts/convert_manpages_to_pdfs.sh, are generated from the markdown
# sources in man/ and are not tracked. 'make dist' ships the pages anyway,
# so building from a release tarball needs no pandoc.
/man/manpages
# Objects, the generated config.h and the dependency files: one tree per
# target triple and build flavour (see src/Makefile). Several flavours and
# cross targets coexist there, which is what the out-of-tree autotools
# builds used to be for.
/src/build

# the source distribution built by 'make dist'
/dist
